---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Physical Sovereignty"
	description="Sustainable, independent fulfillment for creators."
	pubDate={new Date()}
	heroImage="/og-default.png"
>
	<h1>Physical Sovereignty</h1>
	<p>
		True independence means owning the entire chain—from the creation of the work to the moment it lands in the customer's hands.
	</p>
	<h2 class="service">Indie-Author Launchpad</h2>
	<p>
		Fulfillment-as-a-Service for independent authors. We provide the storage, the shipping, and the logistics, so you can focus on the writing.
	</p>
	<h2 class="service">The Anti-KDP Guarantee</h2>
	<p>
		Unlike corporate platforms, we believe the author should own the customer relationship and the data. Total ownership. No parasitic middlemen.
	</p>
	<h2 class="service">Sustainable Logistics</h2>
	<p>
		We use upcycled packaging and lean, non-corporate supply chain methods to minimize our footprint on the planet.
	</p>
</Layout>
